1
00:00:00,011 --> 00:00:01,608
Ben Goes Fishing
本去钓鱼

2
00:00:01,891 --> 00:00:03,847
Ben and his dad went fishing
Ben和他爸爸去钓鱼了

3
00:00:03,971 --> 00:00:05,368
Ben took the pole
Ben拿了杆子

4
00:00:05,971 --> 00:00:07,927
His dad took some worms
他爸爸吃了些虫子

5
00:00:08,330 --> 00:00:09,567
They got on a boat
他们上了船

6
00:00:10,170 --> 00:00:11,848
The boat was in Pine Lake
船在松树湖

7
00:00:12,490 --> 00:00:14,128
Ben's dad drove the boat
Ben的爸爸开的船

8
00:00:14,330 --> 00:00:15,848
He knows where to find the fish
他知道鱼在哪

9
00:00:16,210 --> 00:00:17,807
Ben liked the boat ride
Ben喜欢坐船

10
00:00:17,850 --> 00:00:19,408
Ben put a worm on the hook
Ben在钩子上放了条虫子

11
00:00:19,411 --> 00:00:20,928
He put his line in the water
他把鱼线放到水里

12
00:00:21,451 --> 00:00:22,928
He felt the pole pull
他感觉到了杆子的拉力

13
00:00:22,931 --> 00:00:23,928
Was it a fish?
是鱼吗？

14
00:00:23,931 --> 00:00:25,007
He reeled it in
他把它卷了进来

15
00:00:25,291 --> 00:00:26,568
He did not get a fish
他没有得到一条鱼

16
00:00:26,611 --> 00:00:27,841
Ben got an old can
Ben有个旧罐子

